---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'NRP Fall Training Sessions - September 2025',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-6">NRP Fall Training Sessions</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-100 mb-4 font-bold">September 2025 - All Sessions Completed</p>
      
      <!-- Completion Notice -->
      <div class="bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 border-2 border-green-400 dark:border-green-600 rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-800 dark:text-green-200 mb-4">🎉 Training Series Complete!</h2>
        <div class="text-lg text-green-700 dark:text-green-100 mb-4">
          <p>All training sessions have been completed. Access recordings and materials below.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-8">A comprehensive series of workshops, tutorials, and hands-on sessions designed to help you get started with the NRP, accelerate your research, and connect with the community. All sessions are now available as recordings!</p>
      <a href="#recordings" class="inline-block bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg shadow transition">📺 Watch Recordings</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">About the Training</h2>
      <p class="mb-2">You do not need to attend every session—choose based on your role and interests. <span class="font-bold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-300">All are welcome to attend any or all sessions.</span></p>
      <div class="mb-2">
        <span class="font-bold">Time:</span>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-4">
          <li>First Session: 10:00 AM PDT / 1:00 PM EDT</li>
          <li>Second Session: 11:00 AM PDT / 2:00 PM EDT</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4">
        <span class="font-bold">Note:</span> Each session has its own Zoom link. See the schedule below for specific links.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">Session Table</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm md:text-base rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-blue-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Session Title</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Description</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Beginner User</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Accustomed User</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">NS Admin / PI</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Instructor</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800">
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Introduction to the National Research Platform <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Overview of NRP's mission, capabilities, how to gain access, and policy guidelines.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">The Portal: GUI Access to Resources <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Navigate the NRP portal, manage namespaces/groups, and explore the integrated LiteLLM interface.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Using JupyterHub and Coder as a User <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Launch and use interactive development environments. Ideal for researchers, students, and educators.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Basic Docker and Kubernetes <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Foundations of containers and orchestration: Pods, Deployments, PVCs, and S3 storage.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Intermediate Kubernetes <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Scripting with kubectl, exposing services, using taints/tolerations, node affinity, and Python APIs.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Agentic Tools and Coding with AI/LLMs <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Explore how to integrate NRP-managed LMs and AI agents into JupyterHub, Coder and your own namespace.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Deploying JupyterHub and Coder <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Learn how to deploy and manage JupyterHub and Coder environments for groups or courses.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Advanced I: GitLab CI/CD and Custom Images <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Use GitLab pipelines to automate image building and deploy custom JupyterHub setups.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900">
              <td class="p-2 border font-bold">Advanced II: VMs, Windows Access, and Edge Use Cases <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-sm">✅ COMPLETED</span></td>
              <td class="p-2 border">Launch and connect to VMs (Linux/Windows), configure networking, and explore advanced edge scenarios.</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✓</td>
              <td class="p-2 border text-center">✘</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="recordings" class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 mb-4">Session Recordings & Materials</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm md:text-base rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-blue-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Date</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Time (Pacific / Eastern)</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Session Title</th>
              <th class="p-3 border font-bold">Recording</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 2</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Introduction to the National Research Platform</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">The Portal: GUI Access to Resources</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 9</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Using JupyterHub and Coder as a User</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Basic Docker and Kubernetes</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 16</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Intermediate Kubernetes</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Agentic Tools and Coding with AI/LLMs</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top">Tuesday, September 23</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Deploying JupyterHub and Coder</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border font-bold align-top" rowspan="2">Tuesday, September 30</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>10:00 AM Pacific / 1:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Advanced I: GitLab CI/CD and Custom Images</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 border"><strong>11:00 AM Pacific / 2:00 PM Eastern</strong></td>
              <td class="p-3 border">Advanced II: VMs, Windows, and Edge Use Cases</td>
              <td class="p-3 border"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 underline font-bold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📺 Watch Recording</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Resources Section -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-blue-50 dark:from-slate-800 dark:to-slate-700 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-200 dark:border-red-800">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-800 dark:text-red-200 mb-6 text-center">📺 All Training Materials Available</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="bg-red-600 text-white p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">🎥 Video Recordings</h4>
              <p class="text-sm mb-4">Complete session recordings with timestamps and chapters</p>
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3p1Zps9-ohB4jE8VRfyS0xjzqgUAFx-Y" 
                 class="inline-block bg-white text-red-600 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105" 
                 target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                📺 Watch All Sessions
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="bg-gray-800 text-white p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">💻 Code & Slides</h4>
              <p class="text-sm mb-4">All code examples, slides, and materials</p>
              <a href="https://github.com/nrp-nautilus/fall25training" 
                 class="inline-block bg-white text-gray-800 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105" 
                 target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                📁 View on GitHub
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-semibold">
            All sessions are now available as recordings! No need to wait for live sessions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Training Survey Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-100 to-pink-100 dark:from-purple-900 dark:to-pink-900 border-t-4 border-purple-400 dark:border-purple-600">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-10 border-4 border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-700">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-purple-800 dark:text-purple-200 mb-6">📝 Share Your Training Experience</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-100 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Your feedback helps us improve future training sessions! Whether you attended one session or all of them, 
          we'd love to hear about your experience, what you learned, and suggestions for improvement.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 text-white rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🎯 Quick Survey</h3>
          <p class="text-lg mb-6 opacity-90">
            Help us understand what worked well and what we can improve for future training series.
          </p>
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdMockFormLinkForTrainingSurvey/viewform" 
             class="inline-block bg-white text-purple-600 font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-xl text-xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-110 border-2 border-white" 
             target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            📝 Take 5-Minute Survey
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
          <div class="bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-900 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-3">⏱️</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-purple-800 dark:text-purple-200">Quick</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-300">5-10 minutes</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-900 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔒</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-pink-800 dark:text-pink-200">Anonymous</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-300">Your privacy protected</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-3">💡</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200">Impactful</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300">Shapes future training</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
